msgstr ""
"Sa a se liv adrès ki pral senkronize ak Andromeda si w chwazi fè sa nan "
"Anviwònman Sistèm."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:929
