"do so in System Settings."
msgstr ""
"Sa a se liv adrès ki pral senkronize soti nan Andromeda si ou chwazi fè sa "
"nan Anviwònman Sistèm."

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:1055
msgid "Settings Saved"
msgstr "Anviwònman Sove"

